before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.lang.annotation.*;
public class Main {
  @Retention(RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME)
  @Target(ElementType.TYPE)
  @interface Mark {}
  @Mark static class Tagged {}
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(Tagged.class.isAnnotationPresent(Mark.class));
  }
}
```

